# Trivy CVE Allowlist
# Add CVE IDs (one per line) that have been reviewed and accepted.
# Format: CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
#
# How to use:
#   1. Review the Trivy scan report artifact in the GitHub Actions run
#   2. Verify the CVE is a false positive or accepted risk
#   3. Add the CVE ID below with a comment explaining why
#   4. Commit and push — the next pipeline run will skip it
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-12345  # False positive: not reachable in our code path
